<Layout title="Privacy — Enquiries to Eugene Zalan" description="How the Eugene Zalan website handles an enquiry prepared through the contact form and links to email or WhatsApp.">
  <article class="legal-page shell section"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</span><h1>Privacy.</h1><h2>Preparing an enquiry</h2><p>The enquiry form prepares a message in your browser. It does not submit your information to a website database or send an email automatically. You choose whether to send the prepared message through your email service.</p><h2>Email and WhatsApp</h2><p>When you choose to send a message, the information you include is shared with Eugene Zalan through your chosen service. Email and WhatsApp operate under their own terms and privacy policies.</p><h2>Local form data</h2><p>This website does not intentionally save your form entries in browser storage. Your browser may offer its own autofill or restoration features.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about information you have shared in an enquiry, contact <a href="mailto:imori@europe.com">imori@europe.com</a>.</p></article>
</Layout>
